2. Feature Ratios:
   - Ratios highlight relationships: 
     - operand_uniqueness_ratio × effort_difficulty_ratio (interaction between operand uniqueness and effort-efficiency).
     - relative_complexity_ratio × v(g) (to emphasize modules with excessive complexity relative to baseline complexity).
     - comment_per_code_ratio × code_density (to focus on documentation adequacy per code density).

